1
00:00:39,320 --> 00:00:44,040
Good morning!

2
00:00:47,040 --> 00:00:54,080
People often ask me, "Why do you wake up so early?"

3
00:00:55,680 --> 00:01:02,720
And with a bit of embarrassment, I usually respond, "Because it's the only time I have for myself."

4
00:01:04,440 --> 00:01:11,480
As an introvert, I need alone time to recharge

5
00:01:12,920 --> 00:01:19,960
Although Koko is my whole world, having alone time helps me feel my best and manage stress

6
00:01:21,440 --> 00:01:28,480
Whether I'm being productive or not, I feel it's okay because this time is entirely mine*

7
00:01:29,400 --> 00:01:36,440
(*T&amp;Cs apply based on a certain someone's sleep quality...)

8
00:01:42,880 --> 00:01:49,920
I recently discovered that if I shake my hair like this, only the shorter strands of my bangs fall down

9
00:01:52,160 --> 00:01:59,200
I plan to go to a morning pilates class, but before that, I'll do a load of laundry

10
00:02:05,120 --> 00:02:12,160
We returned from our Melbourne trip last night, and the washing machine has been running non-stop!

11
00:02:13,280 --> 00:02:17,520
This is already the fourth load (and luckily, the final one)

12
00:02:23,960 --> 00:02:31,000
I was very happy when I found out they offer pilates classes starting 5:15 am near home

13
00:02:32,160 --> 00:02:39,200
We bought this water bottle for Koko, but it turned out to be too heavy for her, so now it's mine 😂

14
00:02:42,960 --> 00:02:50,000
I laid out my gym bag the night before to make packing easier in the morning

15
00:02:50,840 --> 00:02:55,560
I don't really bring a lot of things, just a towel and water

16
00:02:56,920 --> 00:03:03,960
I got this bag from Uniqlo, and I love how light and minimalist it looks

17
00:03:09,120 --> 00:03:15,120
Paired with the yoga mat, I feel a bit like a pro 😎

18
00:03:16,280 --> 00:03:22,280
They don't allow filming on the gym premises, so expect to see me back here real soon

19
00:03:28,600 --> 00:03:34,600
While I was away, the sky has transformed remarkably

20
00:03:35,880 --> 00:03:41,880
Despite the chilly wind, its touch against my skin feels so nice post-workout ☺️

21
00:03:43,040 --> 00:03:49,040
In winter, I find the sunrise to be especially beautiful—slow, serene, and picturesque

22
00:04:02,680 --> 00:04:09,720
I usually lean towards a sweet breakfast, but today I was in the mood for something savoury

23
00:04:10,920 --> 00:04:19,200
I prefer buying whole bread loaves because they stay fresh longer, and they're perfect for thick slices of toast!

24
00:04:23,280 --> 00:04:30,320
I have thought about getting rid of this old toaster, but nothing quite makes toast as perfectly as it does

25
00:04:33,240 --> 00:04:40,280
I'm going to make a sandwich with egg, prawns, and avocado

26
00:04:41,520 --> 00:04:48,560
I feel like Melbourne is truly a foodie's paradise

27
00:04:50,200 --> 00:04:57,240
Every corner of the city was filled with delicious restaurants, and we wanted to try everything

28
00:04:58,160 --> 00:05:05,200
We ate so much food that we were stuffed every day, but it was all worth it ✨

29
00:05:08,720 --> 00:05:15,760
However, once back, I also couldn't wait to start eating homemade food haha

30
00:05:17,800 --> 00:05:24,840
I'd love to lose a bit of body fat and gain a bit more muscle tone

31
00:05:27,560 --> 00:05:34,600
So, I'm going to try making more high-protein recipes

32
00:05:39,200 --> 00:05:46,240
I like to season the prawns with a bit of pepper and smoked paprika

33
00:05:48,120 --> 00:05:55,160
If you like spicy food, adding chilli flakes is also delicious (but I was out 🥲)

34
00:06:01,640 --> 00:06:08,680
The delicious smell of sizzling prawns fills the room ~

35
00:06:19,760 --> 00:06:26,800
While the prawns are cooking, I'll cut an avocado

36
00:06:35,240 --> 00:06:42,280
The prawns look so plump and delicious!

37
00:06:47,280 --> 00:06:54,320
When it comes to seafood, prawns are my favourite

38
00:06:55,400 --> 00:07:02,440
I realize it would be enough food for an open sandwich, but the gym has made me super hungry

39
00:07:04,320 --> 00:07:11,360
I decide to wrap it up to prevent it from spilling when I bite into it

40
00:07:21,800 --> 00:07:28,840
I'm quite proud of my wrapping job! It would also be perfect to take out for a picnic

41
00:07:30,920 --> 00:07:37,960
Ta-daa ✨

42
00:07:40,680 --> 00:07:47,720
Furikake goes very well with this sandwich

43
00:07:50,280 --> 00:07:57,320
I'm going to make a latte to go with my breakfast

44
00:08:03,320 --> 00:08:10,360
I bought some new beans from the grocery store and I'm very excited to try them out

45
00:08:11,720 --> 00:08:18,760
They're supposed to have "robust toffee honey flavours underlined by buttery dark chocolate"

46
00:08:21,640 --> 00:08:28,680
Despite drinking coffee almost daily, I usually can't taste any of these undertones hahah

47
00:08:32,560 --> 00:08:39,600
However, surprisingly, I can strongly taste dark chocolate in this one!

48
00:08:42,320 --> 00:08:49,360
It's been a long time since I've tried any latte art... I guess it looks a bit like a boy waving hello?

49
00:08:52,680 --> 00:08:59,720
The sun is out now, and it's kind of warm, so I'm going to have breakfast on the balcony

50
00:09:01,440 --> 00:09:08,480
I got this book at the airport because the cover was so pretty, but it's actually quite good

51
00:09:11,040 --> 00:09:18,080
I often wonder if I'll have stories to share with Koko once she grows up

52
00:09:19,760 --> 00:09:26,800
I see my life as very ordinary (which is comforting as I'm not fond of the unknown)

53
00:09:28,120 --> 00:09:35,160
But sometimes that also makes it seem a bit boring and uninteresting to share...

54
00:09:36,080 --> 00:09:43,120
Whenever I'm asked what I did, my usual response is "nothing much

55
00:09:45,240 --> 00:09:52,280
The book gently reminds us that even in the midst of ordinary days, everyone holds stories worth sharing

56
00:09:56,520 --> 00:10:03,560
What are some stories from your life that you think you'll share with your children in the future?

57
00:10:05,080 --> 00:10:12,120
If I had a story, it would probably be about how I met the most beautiful person in the world

58
00:10:14,320 --> 00:10:21,360
It would be about making eye contact and falling in love at first sight with her tiny, curious eyes

59
00:10:22,880 --> 00:10:31,480
How much she changed me, teaching me patience and unconditional love every day, and how she brought a beautiful chaos into my life

60
00:10:32,240 --> 00:10:38,160
Yep, I think that would give me enough material to last a lifetime of storytelling!

61
00:10:53,760 --> 00:11:00,800
I'm going to quickly empty the dishwasher and load it with the dishes from today

62
00:11:06,440 --> 00:11:13,480
Cleaning the kitchen at night and unloading the dishwasher in the morning are routines I can't live without

63
00:11:19,000 --> 00:11:26,040
We haven't had time to properly clean the rest of the house since we got back

64
00:11:28,400 --> 00:11:35,440
But having a clean kitchen really clears my mind

65
00:11:39,440 --> 00:11:46,480
From the video I realise that it doesn't look so bad

66
00:11:47,520 --> 00:11:54,560
But upon clear inspection, quite a bit of dust has accumulated while we were away

67
00:11:58,720 --> 00:12:05,760
I’m not sure if it's because of our cats, having a toddler, or if it's just normal...

68
00:12:06,920 --> 00:12:13,960
But we find ourselves needing to vacuum daily—sometimes multiple times a day

69
00:12:15,520 --> 00:12:22,560
We're currently using our old TV cabinet, which is a bit too small for the space

70
00:12:33,440 --> 00:12:40,480
The floors also look clean to the naked eye 😂

71
00:12:45,880 --> 00:12:51,320
But the particle counter on the vacuum couldn't disagree more 🫣

72
00:13:01,480 --> 00:13:08,520
The cats must have really enjoyed using the sofa while we were away, as there is fur everywhere

73
00:13:32,040 --> 00:13:36,080
All done ~

74
00:13:42,720 --> 00:13:49,760
Koko excitedly yelled "jam!" as soon as she saw the toast, so I couldn't not give her some

75
00:13:51,400 --> 00:13:58,440
Look at how well she's eating it 🥹

76
00:13:59,600 --> 00:14:06,640
She's even folding them into tiny sandwiches hahah

77
00:14:12,840 --> 00:14:19,880
Turtle took Koko to the park to learn how to ride the scooter

78
00:14:21,520 --> 00:14:28,560
While they're away, I'm going to try make a Basque cheesecake with cottage cheese!

79
00:14:30,280 --> 00:14:37,320
I previously made it using yoghurt and I thought the texture was a bit different

80
00:14:40,080 --> 00:14:47,120
So this time, I used cottage cheese, which is creamier and more firm

81
00:14:48,600 --> 00:14:55,640
The ingredients are simple: 750g cottage cheese, 100g yoghurt, 4 eggs, vanilla extract, 30g flour, &amp; 100g sugar

82
00:14:56,760 --> 00:15:03,800
Simply blend everything and then transfer into a baking pan

83
00:15:06,600 --> 00:15:13,640
You don't need to line the pan perfectly as I find that the ridges make the cake prettier

84
00:15:15,880 --> 00:15:22,920
Bake at 200C fan for 50 minutes

85
00:15:25,400 --> 00:15:32,440
And I'm cleaning the kitchen again hahah

86
00:15:41,120 --> 00:15:48,160
We have a fair amount of dried laundry, so I'm going to iron it now

87
00:15:50,240 --> 00:15:57,280
It's funny how I used to be okay with not ironing at all

88
00:15:59,040 --> 00:16:06,080
But once I started, I feel compelled to iron everything

89
00:16:11,320 --> 00:16:18,360
I personally find steam irons so much easier to use

90
00:16:29,400 --> 00:16:36,440
Koko's T-shirts are my favourite to iron

91
00:16:38,560 --> 00:16:45,600
They used to be so tiny, but now they're the perfect size to fold easily

92
00:17:03,040 --> 00:17:10,080
When fresh out of the oven, the cake kind of puffy and jiggly, but it will flatten soon

93
00:17:12,920 --> 00:17:19,960
Let it cool down a bit before transferring it to the fridge for at least 6 hours

94
00:17:24,560 --> 00:17:31,600
I couldn't finish ironing everything before they got back, but it's not too bad

95
00:17:34,280 --> 00:17:41,320
Koko is contemplating how she should carry her clothes

96
00:17:42,920 --> 00:17:49,960
She decided to move it to the edge so she can reach it more easily 🥸

97
00:17:52,880 --> 00:17:59,920
My cute tiny helper 🥹

98
00:18:03,680 --> 00:18:10,720
She decided to get changed too while she's at it 😆 No wonder I have so much laundry haha

99
00:18:16,360 --> 00:18:23,400
Turtle finished the ironing while I put Koko to bed

100
00:18:24,720 --> 00:18:31,760
I hate to admit it, but he's much more proficient at ironing than I am hahah

101
00:18:32,720 --> 00:18:39,760
I couldn't wait any longer, so I decided it's time for a taste-test 😎

102
00:18:43,480 --> 00:18:50,520
It smells amazingly sweet

103
00:18:52,000 --> 00:18:59,040
Using a bit of yogurt gave the cake its signature tangy flavor, while cottage cheese contributed to its texture

104
00:19:02,440 --> 00:19:09,480
I'm so proud of this recipe, I can't wait to try matcha and chocolate next time!

105
00:19:10,560 --> 00:19:17,600
It's so delicious and creamy ~

106
00:19:25,680 --> 00:19:32,720
Let me know if you try this recipe!

107
00:19:34,800 --> 00:19:41,840
Turtle also loved it ~

108
00:19:48,000 --> 00:19:55,920
I hope you enjoyed watching this video as much as I enjoyed making it

